  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n ilk b\xF6l\xFCmlerinde kapal\u0131 g\xF6zlerini huzursuzca
    ovu\u015Ftururken yakalad\u0131m seni. Belli ki akl\u0131nda i\xE7inden \xE7\u0131kamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    \xF6yle \u015Feyler var ki, sanki art\u0131k s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131dan patlayacak
    gibisin! <sprite=38> Sana baz\u0131 g\xFCzel haberlerim var. G\xF6zlerini a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131nda,
    benim \u015Fu anda telvelerinde g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm mekan\u0131 sen de g\xF6receksin
    {{isim}}. Hemen giri\u015Finde yan yana \xFC\xE7 buzdolab\u0131 duran bir restoranda
    {{sayi,2,6}} hafta i\xE7inde birileriyle ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftirece\u011Fin konu\u015Fma
    sonras\u0131 g\xF6\u011Fs\xFCn adeta t\u0131ka basa ferahl\u0131kla dolacak."
